title: $:/plugins/nikorion/kms-ontology/fields/status
tags: $:/tags/nikorion/kms/Field
kind: vocab
list: none considering todo doing paused done dropped
blank-value: none
applies-filter: [<currentTiddler>get[role]match[task]] [<currentTiddler>get[role]match[tasklist]] [<currentTiddler>get[role]match[routine]] [<currentTiddler>!has[role]]
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

One value from the vocabulary in `list`, in display order. `none` is the blank value: it stands for the empty field and is never stored.

`status` says how far along a piece of work is, which only means something on a tiddler that //is// a piece of work: `applies-filter` accepts the `task`, `tasklist` and `routine` roles (a routine's status is its current run), and tiddlers with no role at all. When these roles change, change `Field/status/Applies` in each language too: it names them for the reader.
